Six-resistor edge screen, 5 V only
.options reltol=1e-7 abstol=1e-14
Vin in 0 PWL(0 0 1u 0 1.02e-06 5 20u 5)
R0 in n1 169000.0
Cg0 n1 0 0.02p
R1 n1 n2 169000.0
Cg1 n2 0 0.02p
R2 n2 n3 169000.0
Cg2 n3 0 0.02p
R3 n3 n4 169000.0
Cg3 n4 0 0.02p
R4 n4 n5 169000.0
Cg4 n5 0 0.02p
R5 n5 0 169000.0
.save v(in) v(n1) v(n2) v(n3) v(n4) v(n5)
.tran 1n 20u 0 1n
.end
